      "evidence": "The page states that the covering homomorphism's 'kernel is the deck group'. The opened def-lawrence-krammer-bigelow-cover instead states Deck(C-tilde/C) ≅ π1(C,c0)/ker Φ ≅ im Φ = Z². The kernel classifies the covering and corresponds to its fundamental group; the deck group is the quotient.",
